@startuml
autonumber
actor Patient
participant "UI (Frontend)" as UI
participant "Backend Orchestrator" as Backend
participant "Vector DB (Leaflets)" as VDB
participant "MCP Interaction Server" as MCP

Patient -> UI: Enter drug name (e.g. "Warfarin") & click "Add"
UI -> Backend: POST /api/medications { name: "Warfarin" }
Backend -> VDB: Query & verify drug leaflet existence (DEC-2)

alt Leaflet NOT found (Failure Path - FR-11)
    VDB --> Backend: Leaflet Not Found
    Backend --> UI: 404 Error ("Not found in database")
    UI --> Patient: Display error message & block addition
else Leaflet Found & Approved (Approval Step)
    VDB --> Backend: Leaflet confirmed & metadata loaded
    Backend -> MCP: Check interaction with active drug list (FR-07)
    MCP --> Backend: Interaction check result (e.g., alert with Aspirin)
    
    Backend -> Backend: Update active medication list & recalculate schedule (FR-03)
    Backend --> UI: 200 OK { activeList, schedule, interactionAlert }
    UI --> Patient: Render updated timeline & display interaction warning
end
@enduml